<title>USA: Winstar signs interconnect deal with Sprint.</title>
<headline>Winstar signs interconnect deal with Sprint.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>WinStar Communications Inc said on Wednesday it signed an interconnect agreement with Sprint Corp for the metropolitan Chicago area.</p>
<p>The agreement allows WinStar to proceed immediately with its plans to provide local telecommunications services in the entire Chicago area, Winstar said.</p>
<p>The company said it has an interconnect agreement already with Ameritech Corp covering the greater Chicago market.</p>
</text>
